<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA XI 316 FOR NO WICKET AT CLOSE V WINDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA XI 316 FOR NO WICKET AT CLOSE V WINDIES.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Australia XI scored</p>
<p>316 for no wicket at close of play on the first day of their</p>
<p>four-day tour match against West Indies at Bellerive Oval on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>Score - Australia XI 316 for no wicket (Matthew Elliot 153</p>
<p>not out, Matthew Hayden 143 not out) v West Indies.</p>
</text>
